{
  "an5.192:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 5.192 ",
  "an5.192:0.2": "20. Brāhmaṇavagga ",
  "an5.192:0.3": "Doṇabrāhmaṇasutta ",
  "an5.192:1.1": "Atha kho doṇo brāhmaṇo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "an5.192:1.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho doṇo brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an5.192:2.1": "“Sutaṁ metaṁ, bho gotama: ",
  "an5.192:2.2": "‘na samaṇo gotamo brāhmaṇe jiṇṇe vuḍḍhe mahallake addhagate vayoanuppatte abhivādeti vā paccuṭṭheti vā āsanena vā nimantetī’ti. ",
  "an5.192:2.3": "Tayidaṁ, bho gotama, tatheva. ",
  "an5.192:2.4": "Na hi bhavaṁ gotamo brāhmaṇe jiṇṇe vuḍḍhe mahallake addhagate vayoanuppatte abhivādeti vā paccuṭṭheti vā āsanena vā nimanteti. ",
  "an5.192:2.5": "Tayidaṁ, bho gotama, na sampannamevā”ti. ",
  "an5.192:2.6": "“Tvampi no, doṇa, brāhmaṇo paṭijānāsī”ti? ",
  "an5.192:2.7": "“Yañhi taṁ, bho gotama, sammā vadamāno vadeyya: ",
  "an5.192:2.8": "‘brāhmaṇo ubhato sujāto—",
  "an5.192:2.9": "mātito ca pitito ca, saṁsuddhagahaṇiko, yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena, ajjhāyako mantadharo, tiṇṇaṁ vedānaṁ pāragū sanighaṇḍukeṭubhānaṁ sākkharappabhedānaṁ itihāsapañcamānaṁ, padako veyyākaraṇo lokāyatamahāpurisalakkhaṇesu anavayo’ti, mameva taṁ, bho gotama, sammā vadamāno vade